---
import DefaultLayout from '../../layouts/DefaultLayout.astro';
---

<DefaultLayout
  title="Who Uses Wicket"
  subtitle="Projects built with Wicket"
>

  <p>
    Wicket has been production-proven for over twenty years and powers applications in many
    industries — from large financial institutions to nimble startups. This page is a
    community-maintained showcase of projects that use Apache Wicket.
  </p>

  <h2>Showcase Being Rebuilt</h2>
  <p>
    We are in the process of rebuilding the project showcase for the new site. The showcase
    will be driven by community submissions stored as Markdown files in the repository.
  </p>
  <p>
    If you want to submit your project to the showcase before it goes live, please open a
    pull request on the
    <a href="https://github.com/apache/wicket-site" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
      wicket-site repository
    </a>
    and add a Markdown file describing your project to <code>src/content/showcase/</code>.
  </p>

  <h2>How to Submit Your Project</h2>
  <ol>
    <li>
      Fork the
      <a href="https://github.com/apache/wicket-site" target="_blank" rel="noopener">wicket-site</a>
      repository on GitHub.
    </li>
    <li>
      Add a new Markdown file in <code>src/content/showcase/</code> with details about your project.
      Use the following frontmatter fields:
      <ul>
        <li><code>title</code> — Name of your project or company</li>
        <li><code>url</code> — Link to the project website</li>
        <li><code>description</code> — A short description of the project and how it uses Wicket</li>
      </ul>
    </li>
    <li>Open a pull request and the Wicket team will review and merge it.</li>
  </ol>

  <h2>More Ways to Show Your Wicket Love</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      Share what you have built on the
      <a href="/community">users mailing list</a>
    </li>
    <li>
      Answer questions about Wicket on
      <a href="https://stackoverflow.com/questions/tagged/wicket" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Stack Overflow</a>
    </li>
    <li>
      Star the project on
      <a href="https://github.com/apache/wicket" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>
    </li>
  </ul>

</DefaultLayout>
